### 获取所有用户信息
GET http://localhost:5176/salary/users

### 根据empNo获取单个用户信息
GET http://localhost:5176/salary/user?empNo=J001

### 创建新用户
POST http://localhost:5176/salary/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empNo": "J003",
  "name": "Charlie",
  "salary": 9500.0
}

### 更新用户信息
PUT http://localhost:5176/salary/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empNo": "J002",
  "name": "Bob",
  "salary": 16500.0
}

### 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:5176/salary/user?empNo=J001

### 测试用户未找到的情况
GET http://localhost:5176/salary/user?empNo=J999

### 测试删除不存在的用户
DELETE http://localhost:5176/salary/user?empNo=J999

